# {{ app_slug }}

A service deployed to a k3s cluster by **Flux**. You edit YAML, open a
{{ change_request }}, and on merge to `main` the cluster reconciles this repo
into the `{{ app_namespace }}` namespace. There is no `kubectl apply` in the
normal flow.

Generated from the **weisssrv-app-template** copier template. The exact source
is recorded as `_src_path` in `.copier-answers.yml`, alongside the answers
`copier update` replays.

